---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Javier Cruz Galera: Performance marketing, in the open."
  description="Practical playbooks, tools, and honest writing on paid media attribution, A/B testing, and growth marketing for B2B SaaS marketers."
>

  <!-- Hero -->
  <section class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 pt-24 pb-20">
    <div class="max-w-2xl">
      <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-bold text-gray-900 leading-tight mb-4">
        B2B Paid Media Playbooks for Performance Marketers
      </h1>
      <h2 class="text-xl font-normal text-gray-700 leading-snug mb-8">
        Performance marketing, in the open.
      </h2>
      <p class="text-lg text-gray-600 mb-10 leading-relaxed">
        Most of what I know about performance marketing I did not figure out alone (aside from
        countless hours of research, and online courses). I had managers and senior operators who
        were generous with their time and ruthless with their feedback. They taught me that the
        work is only as good as the decision it changes, and that a test you cannot defend is not
        really a test. This site is me writing those lessons down and passing them forward.
      </p>
      <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-4">
        <a
          href="/playbooks"
          class="bg-blue-600 text-white px-6 py-3 rounded-lg font-medium hover:bg-blue-700 transition-colors"
        >
          Read the Playbooks
        </a>
        <a
          href="/lab-notes"
          class="border border-gray-200 text-gray-700 px-6 py-3 rounded-lg font-medium hover:border-gray-400 hover:text-gray-900 transition-colors"
        >
          See the Lab Notes
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 pb-20">
    <h2 class="text-xs font-semibold text-gray-400 uppercase tracking-widest mb-10">Take a tour</h2>
    <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
      <a href="/playbooks" class="group block rounded-lg focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-4">
        <img
          src="/images/home/home-playbooks-hn-audience-map.png"
          alt="Network map of Hacker News commenter overlap across AI infrastructure companies"
          width="1600"
          height="900"
          loading="lazy"
          decoding="async"
          class="aspect-video w-full rounded-lg object-cover border border-gray-200"
        />
        <h3 class="font-semibold text-gray-900 mt-4 mb-2 group-hover:text-blue-600 transition-colors">Playbooks</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">Playbooks on performance marketing reporting, testing, and the operational work.</p>
      </a>
      <a href="/lab-notes" class="group block rounded-lg focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-4">
        <img
          src="/images/home/home-lab-notes-conversion-flow.png"
          alt="Flow diagram of a form submission moving from a website through Google Tag Manager into Google Ads"
          width="757"
          height="426"
          loading="lazy"
          decoding="async"
          class="aspect-video w-full rounded-lg object-cover border border-gray-200"
        />
        <h3 class="font-semibold text-gray-900 mt-4 mb-2 group-hover:text-blue-600 transition-colors">Lab Notes</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">Strategies and workflows being tested, what's changed, and what the data shows, including the things that don't work.</p>
      </a>
      <a href="/tools" class="group block rounded-lg focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-4">
        <img
          src="/images/home/home-tools-attribution-dashboard.png"
          alt="Marketing dashboard showing funnel conversion rates and channel performance against benchmarks"
          width="872"
          height="490"
          loading="lazy"
          decoding="async"
          class="aspect-video w-full rounded-lg object-cover border border-gray-200"
        />
        <h3 class="font-semibold text-gray-900 mt-4 mb-2 group-hover:text-blue-600 transition-colors">Tools</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">Tools are built on the same frameworks and benchmark data I use in practice, Including experimental tools.</p>
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- What this site is -->
  <section class="border-y border-gray-100 bg-gray-50 py-16" aria-labelledby="about-site-heading">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6">
      <h2 id="about-site-heading" class="text-xs font-semibold text-gray-400 uppercase tracking-widest mb-10">
        What this site is
      </h2>
      <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-10">

        <article>
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-3">The craft</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
            Dashboards and reporting that drive decisions, not just describe what happened.
            A/B testing done in a way you can actually defend. The operational workflows behind
            the numbers. These are the parts of performance marketing nobody writes about honestly.
          </p>
          <a
            href="/playbooks"
            class="inline-block mt-4 text-sm font-medium text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-700 transition-colors"
          >
            Read the playbooks →
          </a>
        </article>

        <article>
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-3">The lab</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
            This site is the experiment. Every post is optimized with a real hypothesis.
            Rankings, traffic, and AI-engine visibility are tracked. Results are posted openly
            in Lab Notes, including the things that don't work.
          </p>
          <a
            href="/lab-notes"
            class="inline-block mt-4 text-sm font-medium text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-700 transition-colors"
          >
            See the lab notes →
          </a>
        </article>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</BaseLayout>
